---
// Rich HTML/CSS mockup of Consent Tracking & Automatic STOP handling
---

<div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-surface-200 overflow-hidden text-left text-xs font-sans">
  <div class="bg-surface-900 text-white px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-800">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      <span class="font-medium text-surface-200">Compliance & Consent Engine • Strict Opt-In Enforced</span>
    </div>
    <span class="bg-brand-900 text-brand-300 border border-brand-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]">Zero Spam Policy</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-surface-200 p-5 gap-5 bg-white">
    <!-- Left: Consent Acquisition Channels -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h4 class="font-bold text-surface-900 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-600"></span>
        1. Verified Opt-In Channels
      </h4>
      
      <div class="bg-surface-50 border border-surface-200 rounded-lg p-3 space-y-2">
        <span class="font-semibold text-surface-800 block text-[11px]">Click-to-Chat Website Link</span>
        <div class="flex gap-1.5">
          <input type="text" readonly value="https://wa.me/919876543210?text=I+agree+to+receive+updates" aria-label="Sample click-to-chat opt-in link" class="flex-1 bg-white border border-surface-300 rounded px-2 py-1 text-[10.5px] font-mono text-surface-600" />
          <button type="button" class="bg-surface-200 text-surface-700 px-2 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-medium cursor-default">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-surface-500">Automatically logs IP, timestamp, and source tag when recipient initiates chat.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface-50 border border-surface-200 rounded-lg p-3 flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white border border-surface-300 rounded p-1 flex items-center justify-center">
          <!-- Stylized QR representation -->
          <div class="w-12 h-12 border-2 border-surface-900 grid grid-cols-3 gap-0.5 p-0.5">
            <div class="bg-surface-900"></div><div class="bg-surface-200"></div><div class="bg-surface-900"></div>
            <div class="bg-surface-200"></div><div class="bg-surface-900"></div><div class="bg-surface-200"></div>
            <div class="bg-surface-900"></div><div class="bg-surface-200"></div><div class="bg-surface-900"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-semibold text-surface-800 block text-[11px]">Printable In-Store QR Code</span>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-surface-500">Place at point-of-sale desks or on packaging for transparent customer opt-in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Automated STOP Handling & Suppression -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h4 class="font-bold text-surface-900 text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
        2. Automatic STOP & Suppression Engine
      </h4>

      <div class="bg-red-50/50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-3 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-semibold text-red-900 text-[11px]">Instant Keyword Processing</span>
          <span class="bg-red-200 text-red-800 text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">AUTO-ACTION</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10.5px] text-surface-700">When any user texts <code class="bg-white px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-red-700">STOP</code>, <code class="bg-white px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-red-700">UNSUBSCRIBE</code>, or <code class="bg-white px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-red-700">CANCEL</code>:</p>
        <ul class="text-[10px] text-surface-600 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Instantly added to permanent global suppression list</li>
          <li>System confirmation dispatched to recipient</li>
          <li>Zero outbound broadcasts can ever target this number again</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface-50 border border-surface-200 rounded-lg p-3">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] text-surface-600">
          <span class="font-medium">Active Consent Ratio:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-700">99.1% Healthy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full bg-surface-200 h-2 rounded-full mt-1.5 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="bg-emerald-500 h-full" style="width: 99.1%"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[9.5px] text-surface-400 mt-1">Safeguards your Meta business phone number quality tier (High Tier rating).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
